'''Held in Miyako Messe!''' is an event stage that is only available during the 6th [[Sponsorship BitSummit Memorial!|BitSummit Indie Festival]]. After clearing this stage, the player may progress to the [[Continuation Stage]] [[One more thing... (2018)|One more thing...]].

