==Battleground==
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.
**30 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

